{% call s.prose({ width: "narrow" }) %}
  <p>For a lot of people, this work runs alongside <a href="/therapy/individuals">individual therapy</a>, a private hour that's only about you and the pattern you're trying to change. When addiction has reached into the whole household, family therapy gives everyone a place to say the hard thing and start untangling the roles the addiction handed out. That family work is part of what we do here, and its own page will carry the full picture when it goes live.</p>
  <p>One honest reminder: if you or someone you love is in immediate danger, please use the crisis resources listed further down this page. We are glad to be a steady part of recovery, and we are not an emergency service. When the moment isn't a crisis, we'd be glad to hear from you.</p>
